Package: fuzzel
Version: @DEB_FUZZEL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://codeberg.org/dnkl/fuzzel
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libpixman-1-0, libfontconfig1, libfcft4, libutf8proc3, libepoll-shim0, libpng16-16
Description: Wayland application launcher / dmenu replacement
 fuzzel is a fast, lightweight application launcher for Wayland, in the style
 of rofi/dmenu. Like foot (same author) it has no toolkit dependency: it
 rasterizes glyphs itself via fcft into pixman buffers and presents through
 wl_shm on a wlr-layer-shell overlay. PNG icons via libpng, SVG icons via the
 bundled nanosvg. Runs as a native Wayland client under the iosc compositor.
